# Sona Khata: environment variables
#
# The current prototype needs NO environment variables. It has no server and no
# third-party APIs; every external service (UPI, HUID, WhatsApp, speech) is a
# labelled mock. You do not need a .env file to run the tests or the app.
#
# These are the variables the PLANNED integrations will need. Copy this file
# to .env and fill them in only when that integration is built. Never commit .env.

# --- WhatsApp Business API (karigar channel) ---
# WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
# WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# --- Indic speech: Bhashini or AI4Bharat (ASR/TTS) ---
# BHASHINI_USER_ID=
# BHASHINI_API_KEY=

# --- LLM for the case agent's planner ---
# LLM_API_KEY=

# --- Back-end sync server and database ---
# DATABASE_URL=
